{
  "title": "Nutritious Peruvian Cox Apple Causa Limena",
  "description": "A pungent and crumbly Peruvian dish featuring Cox apple, made with a mother sauce base and served raw friendly in a Causa Limena form, perfect for a post workout meal",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
  "diet": [
    "raw",
